.TH STEEL\-ECHO 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 86590d34" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
steel\-echo \- The S\-REAL\-STEEL game\-day workload: a tiny HTTP service to deploy and break, plus a client\-side load generator.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B steel\-echo
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
The S\-REAL\-STEEL game\-day workload: a tiny HTTP service to deploy and break, plus a client\-side load generator.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B serve
serve /health, /version, / and /metrics (the default)
.TP
.B load
measure availability from the client side (see steel\-echo load \-\-help)
.TP
.B monad\-send
send Monad\-bearing IPv6 frames on a lab veth
.TP
.B monad\-count
count Monad frames per flow label on a lab veth
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-addr \fISTRING\fR
listen address (default :8080)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
